  "title": "· IN-BAG | CELINE Unveils Fall/Winter 2026 Silk Scarves: The Endless Possibilities of a Scarf ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | CELINE 上架2026秋冬丝巾作品：丝巾的无限可能",
  "excerpt": "CELINE's new creative director Michael Rider transforms scarves into artistic canvases, blending iconic house symbols with whimsical celestial and equestrian illustrations.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-08-04",
  "date_label": "August 04, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/yuiegwz/8ce307d18a4dfa51.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "CELINE"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE has just unveiled its Fall-Winter 2026 scarf collection, with new creative director Michael Rider turning the scarf into a canvas of inspiration. The designs incorporate iconic house symbols such as the Triomphe, chain links, and carriage emblem, alongside whimsical illustrations of personified moons, suns, ribbons, and horses, resulting in a richly artistic and expressive lineup.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "CELINE Infinite Possibilities scarf campaign film (swipe left/right for more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The scarf is one of Michael Rider's most significant design elements—from the debut show invitation and suit lapels to trench coat linings and flowing hemlines. No longer confined to the neck, scarves have become decorative components on garments, handbags, and headwear, creating a visual tension between sensuality and restraint, while lending a graceful, rhythmic motion to every silhouette.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Michael Rider, fashion designer, American nationality, graduated from Brown University, previously served as Céline ready-to-wear design director (2008–2018), Polo Ralph Lauren creative director (2018–2024), and CELINE creative director (2025–present).",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The scarf is the soul of CELINE—it carries the house's heritage while adapting infinitely to modern life.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
